                    color: FarmColors.primary, size: 30),
                const SizedBox(width: 11),
                Expanded(child: Column(
                  crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                  children: [
                    Text(item == null
                        ? 'No open demand gaps at the moment'
                        : '${item.productName}: ${_farmerPartnerNumber(item.opportunityGap)} ${item.unit} needed',
                      style: const TextStyle(color: FarmColors.deepGreen,
                        fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: FontWeight.w900)),
                    const SizedBox(height: 3),
                    Text(item == null
                        ? 'Check back for new buyer opportunities.'
                        : 'Open the demand board to review the buyer need before offering supply.',
                      style: const TextStyle(color: FarmColors.mutedText,
                          fontSize: 10.5, height: 1.3)),
                  ],
                )),
                const Icon(Icons.chevron_right_rounded,
                    color: FarmColors.deepGreen),
              ]),
            ),
          ),
        ),
      ]),
    );
  }
}


// ============================================================================
// HPJ FARMER MVP — IMAGE-CARD HOME
// Reference-driven phone layout: Today -> attention -> buyer opportunity ->
// supply -> collections/payments -> Grow & Community.
// Uses only existing HPJ data/services. No demo demand, money, dates or URLs.
// Desktop Farmer Portal remains unchanged.
// ============================================================================
class _HpjFarmerReferenceHome extends StatefulWidget {
  final FarmerProfile profile;
  final List<FarmerSupplyForecast> supplies;
  final List<FarmerSupplyForecast> suppliesNeedingReview;
  final List<FarmerMarketDemandOpportunity> demand;
  final Set<String> matchingDemandKeys;
  final List<FarmerCollectionScheduleItem> collections;
  final List<FarmerPayout> payouts;
  final UserExperiencePreferences preferences;
  final int refreshKey;
  final HpjAgricultureFeedAction onAgricultureAction;
  final VoidCallback onSupply;
  final VoidCallback onDemand;
  final VoidCallback onOrders;
  final VoidCallback onPayments;
  final VoidCallback onCollections;
  final VoidCallback onAccount;

  const _HpjFarmerReferenceHome({
    required this.profile,
    required this.supplies,
    required this.suppliesNeedingReview,
    required this.demand,
    required this.matchingDemandKeys,
    required this.collections,
    required this.payouts,
    required this.preferences,
    required this.refreshKey,
    required this.onAgricultureAction,
    required this.onSupply,
    required this.onDemand,
    required this.onOrders,
    required this.onPayments,
    required this.onCollections,
    required this.onAccount,
  });

  @override
  State<_HpjFarmerReferenceHome> createState() =>
      _HpjFarmerReferenceHomeState();
}

class _HpjFarmerReferenceHomeState extends State<_HpjFarmerReferenceHome> {
  static const _green = Color(0xFF0E6945);
  static const _deepGreen = Color(0xFF075136);
  static const _ink = Color(0xFF172C21);
  static const _muted = Color(0xFF657269);
  static const _line = Color(0xFFDDE8DD);
  static const _soft = Color(0xFFF5F9F3);
  static const _gold = Color(0xFFC98B0B);

  late Future<FarmPublicProfileBundle> _bundleFuture;
  late Future<HpjSponsorCampaign?> _sponsorFuture;

  @override
  void initState() {
    super.initState();
    _bundleFuture = _loadBundle();
    _sponsorFuture = fetchActiveFarmerHomeSponsor();
  }

  @override
  void didUpdateWidget(covariant _HpjFarmerReferenceHome oldWidget) {
    super.didUpdateWidget(oldWidget);
    if (oldWidget.profile.id != widget.profile.id ||
        oldWidget.refreshKey != widget.refreshKey) {
      _bundleFuture = _loadBundle();
      _sponsorFuture = fetchActiveFarmerHomeSponsor();
    }
  }

  Future<FarmPublicProfileBundle> _loadBundle() {
    return fetchFarmPublicProfileBundle(
      widget.profile.id,
      includeUnpublished: true,
    );
  }

  String _firstName() {
    final name = widget.profile.farmerName.trim();
    if (name.isEmpty) return 'Farmer';
    return name.split(RegExp(r'\s+')).first;
  }

  String _greeting() {
    final hour = DateTime.now().hour;
    if (hour < 12) return 'Good morning,';
    if (hour < 17) return 'Good afternoon,';
    return 'Good evening,';
  }

  String _money(double value) {
    final rounded = value.roundToDouble();
    final amount = value == rounded
        ? rounded.toInt().toString()
        : value.toStringAsFixed(2);
    final parts = amount.split('.');
    final raw = parts.first;
    final buffer = StringBuffer();
    for (var i = 0; i < raw.length; i++) {
      final remaining = raw.length - i;
      buffer.write(raw[i]);
      if (remaining > 1 && remaining % 3 == 1) buffer.write(',');
    }
    return 'J\$${buffer.toString()}${parts.length > 1 ? '.${parts[1]}' : ''}';
  }

  String _shortDate(DateTime? date) {
    if (date == null) return 'Not set';
    const months = <String>[
      'Jan', 'Feb', 'Mar', 'Apr', 'May', 'Jun',
      'Jul', 'Aug', 'Sep', 'Oct', 'Nov', 'Dec',
    ];
    return '${months[date.month - 1]} ${date.day}';
  }

  String _fullDate(DateTime? date) {
    if (date == null) return 'Not scheduled';
    const months = <String>[
      'Jan', 'Feb', 'Mar', 'Apr', 'May', 'Jun',
      'Jul', 'Aug', 'Sep', 'Oct', 'Nov', 'Dec',
    ];
    return '${months[date.month - 1]} ${date.day}, ${date.year}';
  }

  String _todayDate() {
    final now = DateTime.now();
    const days = <String>['Mon', 'Tue', 'Wed', 'Thu', 'Fri', 'Sat', 'Sun'];
    const months = <String>[
      'Jan', 'Feb', 'Mar', 'Apr', 'May', 'Jun',
      'Jul', 'Aug', 'Sep', 'Oct', 'Nov', 'Dec',
    ];
    return '${days[now.weekday - 1]}, ${months[now.month - 1]} ${now.day}';
  }

  double _supplyQuantity(FarmerSupplyForecast item) {
    var best = 0.0;
    for (final value in <double>[
      item.harvestedQuantity ?? 0,
      item.expectedQuantity ?? 0,
      item.quantityGrowing ?? 0,
    ]) {
      if (value.isFinite && value > best) best = value;
    }
    return best;
  }

  bool _matchesMySupply(FarmerMarketDemandOpportunity item) {
    return widget.matchingDemandKeys.contains(
      hpjFarmerDemandWatchKey(item.productName, item.unit),
    );
  }

  FarmerMarketDemandOpportunity? get _featuredDemand {
    if (widget.demand.isEmpty) return null;
    final rows = List<FarmerMarketDemandOpportunity>.from(widget.demand);
    rows.sort((a, b) {
      int score(FarmerMarketDemandOpportunity item) {
        var value = 0;
        if (_matchesMySupply(item)) value += 100000;
        if (item.demandSignal == 'committed_need') value += 50000;
        if (item.demandSignal == 'urgent') value += 30000;
        final due = item.nextNeedBy;
        if (due != null) {
          final days = due.difference(DateTime.now()).inDays;
          if (days <= 3) value += 12000;
          else if (days <= 7) value += 6000;
        }
        value += item.opportunityGap.round();
        return value;
      }
      return score(b).compareTo(score(a));
    });
    return rows.first;
  }

  FarmerCollectionScheduleItem? get _nextCollection {
    if (widget.collections.isEmpty) return null;
    final rows = List<FarmerCollectionScheduleItem>.from(widget.collections)
      ..sort((a, b) => a.collectionDate.compareTo(b.collectionDate));
    return rows.first;
  }

  double get _pendingPayment => widget.payouts
      .where((item) => item.payoutStatus == 'pending')
      .fold<double>(0, (sum, item) => sum + item.netAmount);

  int get _pendingPaymentCount =>
      widget.payouts.where((item) => item.payoutStatus == 'pending').length;

  String? _productImage(String crop, List<Product> products) {
    final key = hpjSmartNormalizeSearch(crop);
    if (key.isEmpty) return null;
    Product? best;
    for (final product in products) {
      final productKey = hpjSmartNormalizeSearch(product.name);
      if (productKey == key) {
        best = product;
        break;
      }
      if (best == null &&
          (productKey.contains(key) || key.contains(productKey))) {
        best = product;
      }
    }
    final raw = best?.imageUrl?.trim() ?? '';
    return cleanHostedImageUrl(raw);
  }

  String? _farmImage(FarmPublicProfileBundle bundle) {
    final cover = cleanHostedImageUrl(bundle.profile?.coverImageUrl);
    if (cover != null) return cover;
    for (final photo in bundle.photos) {
      final image = cleanHostedImageUrl(photo.imageUrl);
      if (image != null) return image;
    }
    for (final product in bundle.products) {
      final image = cleanHostedImageUrl(product.imageUrl);
      if (image != null) return image;
    }
    return null;
  }

  Widget _networkImage({
    required String? url,
    required BoxFit fit,
    Widget? fallback,
  }) {
    final clean = cleanHostedImageUrl(url);
    if (clean == null) {
      return fallback ??
          const DecoratedBox(
            decoration: BoxDecoration(
              gradient: LinearGradient(
                begin: Alignment.topLeft,
                end: Alignment.bottomRight,
                colors: [Color(0xFFDCEED8), Color(0xFF78A06E)],
              ),
            ),
          );
    }
    return Image.network(
      clean,
      fit: fit,
      filterQuality: FilterQuality.medium,
      errorBuilder: (_, __, ___) => fallback ??
          const DecoratedBox(
            decoration: BoxDecoration(
              gradient: LinearGradient(
                begin: Alignment.topLeft,
                end: Alignment.bottomRight,
                colors: [Color(0xFFDCEED8), Color(0xFF78A06E)],
              ),
            ),
          ),
    );
  }

  BoxDecoration _surface({double radius = 18, Color color = Colors.white}) {
    return BoxDecoration(
      color: color,
      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(radius),
      border: Border.all(color: _line),
      boxShadow: const [
        BoxShadow(
          color: Color(0x0A103C25),
          blurRadius: 14,
          offset: Offset(0, 5),
        ),
      ],
    );
  }

